    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f9/Kilty_%26_Patch_Sharp_Paired_Blades_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260314233649\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Kilty &amp; Patch Sharp Paired Blades Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f9/Kilty_%26_Patch_Sharp_Paired_Blades_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260314233649\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1014\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Kilty &amp; Patch Sharp Paired Blades Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Kilty_%26_Patch_Sharp_Paired_Blades_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>锐利双刃</b>\n</p><p>一对战士姐妹花，'<i>吉尔蒂与帕奇</i>\" 以令人眼花缭乱的配合攻击猎杀猎物。\n她们交叉交错的巨大双刃，以斩击和夹击攻势瞬间剥夺对手的距离与架势。\n据说当她们呼吸同步的瞬间，就连逃跑的路线也会被切断。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8a/Kilty_and_Patch_Sharp_Paired_Blades_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260314233821\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Kilty and Patch Sharp Paired Blades S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8a/Kilty_and_Patch_Sharp_Paired_Blades_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260314233821\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"997\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Kilty and Patch Sharp Paired Blades S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Kilty_and_Patch_Sharp_Paired_Blades_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a7/Kilty_and_Patch_SPB_Blooming_in_the_Rain_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260619200624\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Kilty and Patch SPB Blooming in the Rain Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a7/Kilty_and_Patch_SPB_Blooming_in_the_Rain_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260619200624\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"957\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Kilty and Patch SPB Blooming in the Rain Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Kilty_and_Patch_SPB_Blooming_in_the_Rain_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820012428\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:40239-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260820012428 and revision id 64999. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
